        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "There shall be no discrimination as defined by applicable Federal, New York State, and New York City laws, against any present or future employee by reason of race, creed, color, religion, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, age, physical or mental disability, membership or non-membership in the Association, by either the Employer or the Association. However, this provision is not intended to condone activity which would otherwise constitute just cause for disciplinary action.",
